# Explicit Python requirement overrides for this deployment image.
#
# Use this file only when two or more active direct requirements request the
# same package incompatibly and a human has decided the exact replacement line.
# The normalizer removes the conflicting active lines and writes this selected
# line into the effective pip-compile input.
#
# Do not use this as a casual pinning file. Prefer requirements.in for selected
# extra packages and requirements-constraints.in for compatibility bounds.
#
# Example:
# idna==3.4
